 files...."write") and download the callsign database with no region and 50 char record size.  And it all works!<br><br>So for me, this is how I got past the "Radio not connected" mode.  I had also tried from my wife's Windows 11 system with GD77 CPS, but same error.  I don't see a Win11 driver in that DfuSe package, so I didn't get it working on her system.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=4186">N0PZE</a> — Tue Jul 18, 2023 4:42 pm</p><hr />
